		"description": "<h2>Lope</h2><p>Your speed increases by +5ft.</p><h2>Persistence</h2><p>You require only 4 hours of rest to complete a long rest and may be active for 18 hours a day without incurring fatigue.</p><h2>Pounce</h2><p>You can use a bonus action to make a leap without provoking opportunity attacks. The distance of the leap is 5ft per point of proficiency bonus.</p><p>You may use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency modifier and recover expended uses on a long rest.</p>",
